     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CapabilityStatement mii-cps-medikation-capabilitystatement</b></p><a name=\"mii-cps-medikation-capabilitystatement\"> </a><a name=\"hcmii-cps-medikation-capabilitystatement\"> </a><h2 id=\"title\">MII CPS Medikation CapabilityStatement</h2><ul><li>Implementation Guide Version: 2026.0.1 </li><li>FHIR Version: 4.0.1 </li><li>Supported Formats: <code>xml</code>, <code>json</code></li><li>Published on: 2026-02-13 </li><li>Published by: Medizininformatik Initiative </li></ul><blockquote class=\"impl-note\"><p><strong>Note to Implementers: FHIR Capabilities</strong></p><p>Any FHIR capability may be 'allowed' by the system unless explicitly marked as 'SHALL NOT'. A few items are marked as MAY in the Implementation Guide to highlight their potential relevance to the use case.</p></blockquote><h2 id=\"rest\">FHIR RESTful Capabilities</h2><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h3 id=\"mode1\" class=\"panel-title\">Mode: <code>server</code></h3></div><div class=\"panel-body\"/></div><h3 id=\"resourcesCap1\">Capabilities by Resource/Profile</h3><h4 id=\"resourcesSummary1\">Summary</h4><p>The summary table lists the resources that are part of this configuration, and for each resource it lists:</p><ul><li>The relevant profiles (if any)</li><li>The interactions supported by each resource (<b><span class=\"bg-info\">R</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">S</span></b>earch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">U</span></b>pdate, and <b><span class=\"bg-info\">C</span></b>reate, are always shown, while <b><span class=\"bg-info\">VR</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">P</span></b>atch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">D</span></b>elete, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">I</span></b>nstance, or <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">T</span></b>ype are only present if at least one of the resources has support for them.</li><li><span>The required, recommended, and some optional search parameters (if any). </span></li><li>The linked resources enabled for <code>_include</code></li><li>The other resources enabled for <code>_revinclude</code></li><li>The operations on the resource (if any)</li></ul><div class=\"table-responsive\"><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th><b>Resource Type</b></th><th><b>Profile</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET a resource (read interaction)\">R</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET all set of resources of the type (search interaction)\">S</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"PUT a new resource version (update interaction)\">U</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"POST a new resource (create interaction)\">C</b></th><th><b title=\"Required and recommended search parameters\">Searches</b></th><th><code><b>_include</b></code></th><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operations</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#List1-1\">List</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/list.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/List</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-medikation-medikationsliste.html\">MII PR Medikation Medikationslisteversion: 2026.0.1)</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_count, _summary, _id, _lastUpdated, _profile, code, date, empty-reason, encounter, identifier, item, patient, source, status, subject, mode</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Medication1-2\">Medication</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/medication.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Medication</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-medikation-medication.html\">MII PR Medikation Medicationversion: 2026.0.1)</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_count, _summary, _id, _lastUpdated, _profile, code, expiration-date, form, identifier, ingredient, ingredient-code, lot-number, manufacturer, status, ingredient-strength, ingredient-strength-numerator, ingredient-strength-denominator</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#MedicationAdministration1-3\">MedicationAdministration</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/medicationadministration.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/MedicationAdministration</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-medikation-medication-administration.html\">MII PR Medikation MedicationAdministrationversion: 2026.0.1)</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_count, _summary, _id, _lastUpdated, _profile, code, context, effective-time, identifier, medication, patient, performer, reason-given, reason-not-given, request, status, subject, dosage-site, dosage-route, dose-quantity, ratequantity, rateratio-numerator, rateratio-denominator, rateratio, part-of</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#MedicationRequest1-4\">MedicationRequest</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/medicationrequest.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/MedicationRequest</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-medikation-medication-request.html\">MII PR Medikation MedicationRequestversion: 2026.0.1)</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"